      publishing a Build for download, bundling it in a product or template,
      and sending it to a colleague or client.

   b. Sell, rent, sublicense, or offer the Software or a Build as a service.

   c. Remove or alter this licence, the copyright notices, or the third-party
      notices.

   Publicly forking this repository on a code-hosting service, so long as the
   fork carries this licence unchanged and contains no Build, is not
   distribution for the purpose of clause 3(a).

